{"id":1915,"date":"2023-04-05T14:57:10","date_gmt":"2023-04-05T05:27:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=1915"},"modified":"2023-04-12T08:32:07","modified_gmt":"2023-04-11T23:02:07","slug":"shopping-feed-management-better-reach","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/","title":{"rendered":"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1915\" class=\"elementor elementor-1915\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-380374d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"380374d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-516cd89 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"516cd89\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Shopping Feed Management actively optimizes and manages a product catalog, promoting products across multiple online shopping channels like Google and Bing Shopping. This process demands continuous management of product data feeds, encompassing product information such as title, description, images, price, and availability.<\/p><div><p>There are three main stages in shopping feed management.<\/p><ol><li>Firstly, connection involves getting your products into the shopping channel through Google or Bing Merchant Center. This connection is your shopping feed.\u00a0<\/li><li>Secondly, policy compliance plays a crucial role. Both Google and Bing enforce rules, and if your product data fails to comply, your products simply won&#8217;t appear.\u00a0<\/li><li>Finally, optimization offers the opportunity to outshine competitors and secure sales by improving your ranking.<\/li><\/ol><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8be7957 elementor-toc--minimized-on-tablet elementor-widget elementor-widget-table-of-contents\" data-id=\"8be7957\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;headings_by_tags&quot;:[&quot;h2&quot;,&quot;h3&quot;],&quot;exclude_headings_by_selector&quot;:[],&quot;marker_view&quot;:&quot;numbers&quot;,&quot;no_headings_message&quot;:&quot;No headings were found on this page.&quot;,&quot;minimize_box&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;minimized_on&quot;:&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;hierarchical_view&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;min_height&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_laptop&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"table-of-contents.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-toc__header-title\">\n\t\t\t\tJump to section\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--expand\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__8be7957\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--collapse\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__8be7957\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Close table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-up\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-toc__8be7957\" class=\"elementor-toc__body\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__spinner-container\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"elementor-toc__spinner eicon-animation-spin e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M500 975V858C696 858 858 696 858 500S696 142 500 142 142 304 142 500H25C25 237 238 25 500 25S975 237 975 500 763 975 500 975Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4340e3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f4340e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bebdae4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bebdae4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Connecting is a great first step towards successful shopping feed management<\/h2><div><div><div><p>To enhance product visibility and advertise, connect your product data to a shopping channel&#8217;s Merchant Center. The Merchant Center transfers crucial product details like prices, images, and other attributes. This aids in managing and improving product content while initiating shopping feed management.<\/p><p>To display shopping ads to potential customers looking for similar products, upload your products to the relevant Merchant Center. This process ensures your products appear in Google and Bing search results, attracting your target audience and increasing traffic and sales.<\/p><p>Ensure your product data complies with the shopping channel&#8217;s requirements for proper display. If your data doesn&#8217;t comply, edit it to ensure proper formatting and inclusion of all necessary attributes. Proceed with advertising if your website data meets these requirements.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f35794e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f35794e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de89ed6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de89ed6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Fixing policy violations is essential.<\/h2><p>Both Google and Bing Merchant Centers have rules to ensure that advertisers maintain high quality and honesty, and provide a good experience for customers and advertisers. Advertisers must obey these rules to use the Merchant Centers and advertise their products on these shopping platforms.<\/p><p>The rules cover a wide range of issues, such as data quality, product data accuracy, and product safety. It is important to provide correct and up-to-date product information, use appropriate language and pictures, and obey relevant laws and regulations.<\/p><p>By obeying these rules, advertisers can enjoy several benefits. First, they can keep using both Google&#8217;s and Bing&#8217;s Shopping platforms and reach potential customers. Also, following the rules helps build trust with customers, as they know they can trust the products they see and buy are safe.<\/p><p>Moreover, following the rules can help advertisers improve ad performance. Both Google&#8217;s and Bing&#8217;s systems consider data quality and accuracy when choosing which ads to show, so ads that obey the rules are more likely to be seen by potential customers.<\/p><p>Put simply, obeying Merchant Center rules is important to maximize growth and stay visible on both Google&#8217;s and Bing&#8217;s Shopping platforms.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91d9cde e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"91d9cde\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad9ad07 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ad9ad07\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-07c7ff0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"07c7ff0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Optimization of shopping feeds for growth<\/h2><div><p>Optimizing your shopping feed, a part of shopping feed management, fine-tunes product data quality, accuracy, and relevance. By doing so, you can attract more customers and increase sales. Here&#8217;s how:<\/p><p><strong>Better visibility in search results:<\/strong> Accurate and detailed product information makes it easier for search engines to display your products in search results. <b>Improved click-through rates: <\/b>Relevant and precise product data increases the chances of potential customers clicking on your ads. <b>Higher conversion rates:<\/b> Detailed product information gives customers the confidence to complete a purchase. <b>Better targeting:<\/b> Specific attributes like size, color, or price range help target products to interested customers.<\/p><p>Shopping feed management is a powerful process.\u00a0<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem; text-align: var(--text-align);\">By providing search engines and potential customers with accurate, relevant, and detailed product information, you can improve your visibility, click-through rates, conversion rates, and targeting, ultimately driving more traffic and revenue to your business. Increasing sales is the goal of shopping feed management<\/span><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7201795 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7201795\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-475d6aa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"475d6aa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>How to edit your product data feed<\/h2><div>Editing a shopping data feed is the hands on part of shopping feed management. It involves making changes to the data attributes for each product in your shopping feed. Here are the general steps to follow if you would like to do it manually:<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><ol><li><strong>Access your shopping data feed<\/strong>: Log in to your Merchant Center account and navigate to the &#8220;Products&#8221; tab. From there, you can access your product data feed.<\/li><li><strong>Identify the product(s) you want to edit:<\/strong> Use the search and filter options to find the product(s) you want to edit. You can search by product ID, title, or any other relevant attribute.<\/li><li><strong>Make the necessary changes:<\/strong> Once you&#8217;ve identified the product(s) you want to edit, click on the product ID to view its details. From there, you can make changes to any of the available data attributes, such as title, description, price, or image.<\/li><li><strong>Save your changes:<\/strong> After making your changes, be sure to save them before exiting the product details page. You can save changes to individual products or multiple products at once.<\/li><li><strong>Monitor your feed for errors:<\/strong> Once you&#8217;ve made your edits, monitor your feed for any errors or warnings. These could indicate issues with your data quality, which may affect the performance of your ads.<\/li><li><strong>Re-upload your feed:<\/strong> Once you&#8217;ve made your edits and resolved any errors or warnings, you can re-upload your product data feed to Merchant Center.<\/li><\/ol><h3>How often should you check your shopping feed?<\/h3><p>Keep in mind that shopping data feeds need to be updated regularly to ensure that your product information is accurate and up-to-date. <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By following these steps and regularly updating your product data feed, you can ensure that your ads are displaying accurate and relevant information to potential customers, leading to higher engagement and sales.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem;\">Learn more about <\/span><a style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); font-size: 1.125rem;\" href=\"http:\/\/home\" data-wplink-url-error=\"true\">FeedOps<\/a><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem;\">. Find out how you can <\/span><a style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); font-size: 1.125rem;\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/why-feedops\/\">optimize your product data<\/a><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem;\"> for better advertising returns<\/span><\/p><h2><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-size: 1.125rem;\">Explain it to a 5 Year Old!<\/span><\/h2><p>So, you know how when we want to buy something online, like a toy or a shirt, we have to look at pictures and read about it before we buy it? Well, the people who sell those things online have to make sure the pictures and words are really good, so that more people will want to buy their things.<\/p><p>And sometimes, they use <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">a special tool called a &#8220;shopping feed management&#8221;<\/a> to help them do a really good job with the pictures and words. This tool helps them show their things to more people and helps people find the things they want to buy easier.<\/p><p>So, if the people selling things online use this tool to make their pictures and words better, then more people will buy their things and they can be really successful at selling things online.<\/p><div>\u00a0<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-104e4e8d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"104e4e8d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c824012 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5c824012\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53919b3c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"53919b3c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2033\" alt=\"explain fed optimization to a 5 year old\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1.png 500w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Explain-Feed-Optimization-to-a-5-year-Old-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2385fc92 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2385fc92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6883d529 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6883d529\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Explain a Shopping Feed Management to a 12 year old!<\/h2><p>This article is about a service called &#8220;Shopping Feed Management.&#8221; This service helps sellers who want to sell their products online. It does this by managing the information that they give to websites like Google Shopping or Amazon.<\/p><p>The article explains that with Shopping Feed Management, sellers can make sure that their products show up in more places online. This means that more people will be able to find and buy their products. The service can also help sellers manage their inventory (how many of each product they have available), pricing, and other important details about their products.<\/p><p>So, in short, Shopping Feed Management is a service that helps sellers sell their products online. It does this\u00a0 by managing the information they provide to websites like Google Shopping or Amazon. This can help them reach more customers and make more sales.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shopping Feed Management actively optimizes and manages a product catalog, promoting products across multiple online shopping channels like Google and Bing Shopping. This process demands continuous management of product data feeds, encompassing product information such as title, description, images, price, and availability. There are three main stages in shopping feed management. Firstly, connection involves getting [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":1917,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1915","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shopping Feed Management involves the optimization and management of a product catalog that is used to promote products on shopping channels.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shopping Feed Management involves the optimization and management of a product catalog that is used to promote products on shopping channels.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-04-05T05:27:10+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-11T23:02:07+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2240\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1260\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\"},\"headline\":\"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-04-05T05:27:10+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-04-11T23:02:07+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\"},\"wordCount\":1243,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\",\"name\":\"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-04-05T05:27:10+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-04-11T23:02:07+00:00\",\"description\":\"Shopping Feed Management involves the optimization and management of a product catalog that is used to promote products on shopping channels.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png\",\"width\":2240,\"height\":1260,\"caption\":\"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach And Relevance\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"width\":899,\"height\":929,\"caption\":\"FeedOps\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\",\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/feedops\/\",\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@feedops\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\",\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"caption\":\"Frank Grasso\"},\"description\":\"I\u2019ve managed over $700 million in ad spend, contributing to billions in revenue. I say \\\"contributing\\\" because online success hinges on three key factors: a product people want, a price they\u2019re willing to pay, and timely delivery. The rest is about attention to detail. I'm not your typical digital advertising expert. My background is unconventional. I left school at 14 and worked as a mechanic until I was 33. In 2002, I leveraged my problem-solving skills to launch a $1 million Google Ads campaign for a travel client. This experience taught me how to optimize ad quality and campaign structure to reduce costs. Over time, I witnessed Google\u2019s evolution: from Sponsored Links to AdWords, then Shopping Ads, Smart Shopping, and finally PMax. As Google expanded its digital media dominance, I realized that my agency needed to adapt. That\u2019s when I shifted focus and sold my agency to start FeedOps. At FeedOps, my mission is to help eCommerce businesses sell more products, increase revenue, and reduce ad spend. We focus on relevance, the core of effective digital advertising. By ensuring your product data and ads are highly relevant to user intent, we help you spend less and gain more. Relevance drives everything from higher click-through rates to better conversion rates and lower costs. At FeedOps, we harness this principle to optimize your ads and product data, ensuring you achieve better returns on your advertising investments. My mission is to help advertisers scale their creativity and productivity, and to provide them with the best tools and solutions to reach their target audiences and achieve their goals. I am passionate about leveraging the latest technologies and trends to enhance the capabilities and performance of our software, and to deliver exceptional value and service to our clients. I am also committed to building and nurturing a talented and diverse team of digital marketers and software developers, who share my vision and values of excellence, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/author\/frank-grasso\/\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO Premium plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach","description":"Shopping Feed Management involves the optimization and management of a product catalog that is used to promote products on shopping channels.","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"Shopping Feed Management For Better Customer Reach","og_description":"Shopping Feed Management involves the optimization and management of a product catalog that is used to promote products on shopping channels.","og_url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/","og_site_name":"FeedOps","article_publisher":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops","article_published_time":"2023-04-05T05:27:10+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-04-11T23:02:07+00:00","og_image":[{"width":2240,"height":1260,"url":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Shopping-Feed-Management-For-Better-Customer-Reach-And-Relevance.png","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"Frank Grasso","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"Frank Grasso","Est. reading time":"6 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/shopping-feed-management-better-reach\/"},"author":{"name":"Frank Grasso","@id":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608"},"headline":"Shopping Feed Management For Better Custome